"Without this, KeyAwake stops working when you restart the Mac." = "Sin esto, KeyAwake deja de funcionar al reiniciar el Mac.";
"Closing this window does not stop the boost." = "Cerrar esta ventana no detiene la aceleración.";
"Show log…" = "Mostrar el registro…";

